msgstr "无效状态"

msgid "Product status updated."
msgstr "商品状态已更新。"

msgid "Use rich text to format highlights, lists, and links. The product detail page will show the same layout."
msgstr "可使用富文本排版亮点、列表和链接，商品详情页会同步展示相同布局。"

msgid "Write the story, highlights, materials, and usage scenarios with rich text"
msgstr "用富文本编辑商品故事、亮点、材质和使用场景"

msgid "Please add a product description."
msgstr "请填写商品文案。"

msgid "Order does not belong to this merchant"
msgstr "该订单不属于当前商家。"

msgid "Order #%(order_id)s updated"
msgstr "订单 #%(order_id)s 已更新"

msgid "Your order status changed to %(status)s."
msgstr "你的订单状态已更新为 %(status)s。"

msgid "Order status updated."
msgstr "订单状态已更新。"

msgid "Invalid action"
msgstr "无效操作"

msgid "Create polished product listings faster."
msgstr "更快创建更精致的商品页面。"

msgid "Review every product in one dedicated inventory view."
msgstr "在独立库存视图中集中查看全部商品。"

msgid "Keep listing, stock, status, and edit actions separate from the editor so product operations stay easier to scan."
msgstr "将商品列表、库存、状态和编辑动作与编辑器分开，让商品管理更易浏览。"

msgid "Merchant Workspace"
msgstr "商家工作台"

msgid "Inventory Console"
msgstr "库存控制台"

msgid "Review products, adjust stock, and jump into editing from a cleaner inventory surface."
msgstr "在更清爽的库存界面中查看商品、调整库存并快速进入编辑。"

msgid "Orders Console"
msgstr "订单控制台"

msgid "Work through triage, status updates, and customer context from one command surface."
msgstr "在一个统一工作台中处理订单分流、状态更新和顾客上下文。"

msgid "Order Filters"
msgstr "订单筛选"

msgid "Search by order id or customer identity, then narrow by status and sort without pushing the action button out of the panel."
msgstr "按订单号或顾客身份搜索，再用状态和排序缩小范围，同时保持操作按钮留在筛选面板内部。"

msgid "Result Scope"
msgstr "结果范围"

msgid "Merchant-owned order lines only"
msgstr "仅显示属于当前商家的订单商品项"

msgid "Choose the next step from the controlled workflow on the right. This keeps customer communication and operational timestamps aligned."
msgstr "从右侧受控流程中选择下一步，以保持顾客通知和运营时间戳一致。"

msgid "Product Studio"
msgstr "商品编辑台"

msgid "Shape copy, media, and publish settings in one polished drafting environment."
msgstr "在一个更精致的编辑环境中统一处理文案、图片和发布设置。"

msgid "Product Overview"
msgstr "商品概览"

msgid "Name, category, and selling story"
msgstr "名称、分类与卖点故事"

msgid "Start with the essentials, then write the formatted product narrative customers will see on the detail page."
msgstr "先填写基础信息，再编写顾客会在详情页看到的富文本商品介绍。"

msgid "Publishing Setup"
msgstr "发布设置"

msgid "Price, inventory, and live status"
msgstr "价格、库存与上架状态"

msgid "Decide how the product should be priced, how much stock is available, and whether it is ready for customers."
msgstr "决定商品定价、可售库存，以及是否已准备好面向顾客展示。"

msgid "Visual Assets"
msgstr "视觉素材"

msgid "Cover and gallery uploads"
msgstr "封面与图集上传"

msgid "Use a strong lead image for cards, then add supporting gallery shots for detail views and customer confidence."
msgstr "先用一张强主图支撑卡片展示，再补充细节图集提升详情页说服力。"

msgid "Publishing Checklist"
msgstr "发布检查单"

msgid "Before you save"
msgstr "保存前检查"

msgid "Use this quick checklist to make the product card, list view, and detail page feel complete on first publish."
msgstr "用这份快速检查单，确保商品卡片、列表页和详情页在首次发布时就足够完整。"

msgid "Lead with a clear product name and category so cards scan quickly."
msgstr "先确保商品名称和分类清晰，让列表卡片更容易被快速扫读。"

msgid "Add one strong cover image and multiple gallery shots for trust."
msgstr "准备一张强封面图和多张图集图片，提升顾客信任感。"

msgid "Use short paragraphs and lists in the rich text area for readability."
msgstr "在富文本区域使用短段落和列表，提升阅读体验。"

msgid "Double-check price, stock, and status before you publish."
msgstr "发布前再次核对价格、库存和状态。"

msgid "Save or continue drafting"
msgstr "保存或继续起草"

msgid "Publish changes now, or save this product and immediately start drafting the next listing."
msgstr "现在就保存变更，或保存当前商品后立刻开始下一条商品草稿。"

msgid "Notification Inbox"
msgstr "通知收件箱"

msgid "Track reviews, orders, and merchant-side follow-ups without leaving the workspace."
msgstr "无需离开工作区，就能跟进评价、订单和商家侧后续动作。"

msgid "Customer Workspace"
msgstr "顾客工作台"

msgid "Review product details, media, and purchase options from one focused view."
msgstr "在一个更专注的视图中查看商品详情、图片和购买选项。"

msgid "Review selected items, adjust quantities, and move into checkout with less friction."
msgstr "查看已选商品、调整数量，并更顺畅地进入结账流程。"

msgid "Order Center"
msgstr "订单中心"

msgid "Track every purchase, review totals, and follow status changes from one timeline-driven space."
msgstr "在同一个时间线视图中跟踪每笔购买、查看总额并关注状态变化。"

msgid "Customer Inbox"
msgstr "顾客通知中心"

msgid "Order Summary"
msgstr "订单摘要"

msgid "Account Center"
msgstr "账户中心"

msgid "Update your merchant profile, credentials, and workspace identity from one place."
msgstr "在一个地方更新商家资料、登录凭据和工作区身份信息。"

msgid "Update your profile, manage notifications, and keep your customer details current."
msgstr "在一个地方更新资料、管理通知，并保持顾客信息为最新。"

msgid "Edit each product in a separate workspace so inventory review stays focused."
msgstr "为每个商品提供独立编辑页，让库存巡检保持专注。"

msgid "Upload a cover image, preview gallery photos instantly, and keep pricing, stock, and status in one clean workflow."
msgstr "上传封面图后即可即时预览图集，并在一个清晰流程中维护价格、库存和状态。"

msgid "Build a richer product story with formatted content."
msgstr "用排版更完整的内容讲好商品故事。"

msgid "Use headings, emphasis, lists, and links in the editor below. The product detail page will render the same rich layout for customers."
msgstr "在下方编辑器中使用段落、强调、列表和链接，顾客端详情页会按相同富文本布局展示。"

