msgid "Find better products with less friction."
msgstr "更轻松地找到更合适的商品。"

msgid "Search by category, tag, and price, then jump into image-rich detail pages, reviews, and one-step checkout."
msgstr "按分类、标签和价格搜索，然后进入图文丰富的详情页、评价区和一步结账流程。"

