msgid "Review orders with a clearer workflow."
msgstr "用更清晰的流程查看和处理订单。"

msgid "Filter quickly, inspect customer details, and move each order through translated status steps without losing context."
msgstr "快速筛选、查看顾客详情，并在不丢失上下文的情况下推进每笔订单的本地化状态流程。"

msgid "See product health and order pressure at a glance."
msgstr "一眼看清商品表现和订单压力。"

msgid "Use the dashboard to jump into product edits, order triage, and unread notifications from one place."
msgstr "通过这个仪表盘可以从一个入口快速进入商品编辑、订单处理和未读通知。"

msgid "Order Details"
msgstr "订单详情"

msgid "Back"
msgstr "返回"

msgid "Review the full order summary, shipping details, and status history."
msgstr "查看完整订单摘要、收货信息和状态历史。"

msgid "Sign in to continue browsing products, tracking orders, and managing your storefront."
msgstr "登录后继续浏览商品、跟踪订单并管理你的店铺。"

msgid "Faster checkout"
msgstr "更快结账"

msgid "Pick up where you left off with your cart, orders, and saved address."
msgstr "从购物车、订单和已保存地址的当前位置继续。"

msgid "Unified dashboard"
msgstr "统一工作台"

msgid "Customers and merchants land in the right workflow immediately after login."
msgstr "顾客和商家登录后都会立即进入各自对应的工作流。"

msgid "Use your email and password to access your account."
msgstr "使用邮箱和密码登录你的账户。"

msgid "Open your storefront or start shopping."
msgstr "开启你的店铺，或立刻开始购物。"

msgid "Create one account and move directly into the customer or merchant experience with localized pages and notifications."
msgstr "创建一个账户后即可直接进入顾客或商家体验，并享受本地化页面与通知。"

msgid "Customer ready"
msgstr "顾客模式就绪"

msgid "Save your shipping address once and use it during checkout immediately."
msgstr "一次保存收货地址，结账时即可直接使用。"

msgid "Merchant ready"
msgstr "商家模式就绪"

msgid "Publish products, monitor orders, and respond to reviews from the same dashboard."
msgstr "在同一个工作台中发布商品、监控订单并响应评价。"

msgid "Tip"
msgstr "提示"

msgid "Choose the correct role now. You can start as a customer or jump straight into merchant management."
msgstr "现在请选择正确角色。你可以先作为顾客开始，也可以直接进入商家管理。"

msgid "This product is currently out of stock."
msgstr "该商品当前缺货。"

msgid "Adjust the quantity before adding the item to your cart."
msgstr "加入购物车前可以先调整数量。"

msgid "Tune quantities before checkout."
msgstr "在结账前先调好数量。"

msgid "Update quantities inline, confirm totals instantly, and keep your preferred shipping address ready for checkout."
msgstr "直接在当前页调整数量、即时确认总额，并让常用收货地址随时可用于结账。"

msgid "Items in cart"
msgstr "购物车商品数"

msgid "Browse the catalog and add a few products to start your checkout flow."
msgstr "先去浏览商品并加入几件商品，即可开始结账流程。"

